| `src/browser/` | Embedded browser domain logic | Tab lifecycle, navigation, bookmarks, downloads, profile isolation | UI layout code (that goes in `ui/`), clipboard logic |
| `src/clipboard/` | Smart clipboard domain logic | Clipboard CRUD, search, categorization, storage | Browser code, typing code, UI layout |
| `src/typing/` | Typing engine domain logic | SendInput dispatch, queue management, speed control | Browser code, clipboard code |
| `src/ui/` | Shared presentation-layer widgets | Windows, panels, dialogs, bars, toasts, icon loading | Business logic, database queries, OS API calls |
| `src/models/` | Pydantic data models — shared vocabulary | Model classes only; no logic beyond validation | Database queries, UI code, business rules |
| `src/storage/` | Data access layer | SQLite management, JSON I/O, file utilities, migrations | Business logic, UI code, OS API calls |
| `src/platform/` | Thin OS API wrappers | ctypes/pywin32 wrappers for SendInput, RegisterHotKey, system queries | Business logic, UI code, data access |
| `resources/` | Static bundled assets | Icons (SVG), fonts (TTF), QSS themes, images (PNG/SVG) | Python code, data files, user configuration |
| `tests/` | All test code | Test modules, fixtures, conftest | Production code |
| `scripts/` | Build and CI scripts | PyInstaller config, lint runners, release automation | Production code, test code |
| `data/` | Runtime user data (gitignored) | Workspaces, config, logs, sessions | Source code, resources, tests |

