```

**Lifecycle:** Created per tab; destroyed when tab is closed or workspace is switched

**Error Handling:** `renderProcessTerminated` signal → log error → show in-tab error page → offer reload

**Unit Tests:** URL navigation (mocked engine), context menu construction, signal emission on load events

