# 17. Performance Architecture

## 17.1 Startup Optimization

| Phase | Budget | Technique |
|---|---|---|
| Process start → Python ready | ~1.5s | PyInstaller bundles `.pyc`; minimize imports in `main.py` |
| Python ready → Splash visible | ~300ms | Splash is the first widget; no other initialization before it |
| Splash visible → Modules initialized | ~2s | Deferred init; only active workspace is loaded |
| Modules ready → MainWindow visible | ~500ms | Window construction and first paint |
| **Total** | **< 5s** | — |

## 17.2 Memory Optimization

| Technique | Expected Savings | Implementation |
|---|---|---|
| Lazy tab loading | ~100 MB per unloaded tab | Tab metadata only; load on activate |
| Tab suspension (30 min idle) | ~100 MB per suspended tab | `QWebEnginePage.setLifecycleState(Discarded)` |
| Virtual clipboard list | ~50 MB for 10K entries | `QAbstractListModel` + `QListView` (not QListWidget) |
| Chromium cache cap | Bounded at 200 MB | `QTWEBENGINE_CHROMIUM_FLAGS` environment variable |
| Deferred panel creation | ~20 MB | Settings, Bookmarks panels created on first access |

## 17.3 Query Optimization

| Query | Technique | Target |
|---|---|---|
| Clipboard FTS5 search | `MATCH` with prefix tokens; `bm25()` ranking | < 200ms for 10K entries |
| Clipboard listing | Paginated: `LIMIT/OFFSET` with `ORDER BY is_pinned DESC, created_at DESC` | < 50ms per page |
| History FTS5 search | Same as clipboard FTS5 | < 100ms for 1K entries |
| Bookmark tree | Single query with self-join for folder hierarchy | < 50ms |

## 17.4 Resource Cleanup

| Resource | Cleanup Trigger | Mechanism |
|---|---|---|
| Browser tab renderers | Tab close, workspace switch | `QWebEnginePage.deleteLater()` |
| SQLite connections | Thread exit, workspace switch, shutdown | `conn.close()` in thread-local finalizer |
| QTimer instances | Scope exit, undo expiration | Python GC + Qt parent hierarchy |
| Temporary files | Atomic write completion | `os.replace()` removes old tmp file; orphaned `.tmp` files cleaned on startup |

